#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Credential Vault"
msgstr "Ebe Nchekwa Nzere Nzuzo"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Vault Key File"
msgstr "Faịlụ Igodo Ebe Nchekwa Nzuzo"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Absolute path to the 32-byte key that encrypts stored credentials. Create it yourself, outside the web root, readable only by the web server and poller user, in a directory that only root and that user can write (the same applies to credential files); the plugin never creates or writes it. Back it up with the database: without it, stored credentials must be entered again."
msgstr "Ụzọ zuru oke gaa na igodo 32-byte nke na-ezochi nzere echekwara. Mepụta ya n'onwe gị, n'èzí web root, nke naanị sava web na onye ọrụ poller nwere ike ịgụ, n'ime ndekọ faịlụ nke naanị root na onye ọrụ ahụ nwere ike ide na ya (otu ihe ahụ metụtara faịlụ nzere); mgbakwunye ahụ anaghị emepụta ma ọ bụ dee ya. Chekwaa nkwado ya yana nchekwa data: n'enweghị ya, a ga-etinyerịrị nzere echekwara ọzọ."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Credential File Directory"
msgstr "Ndekọ Faịlụ Nzere"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Absolute path to the directory that holds credential files. An account can read its credential from a file only inside it, never the vault key file. Empty, the default, refuses credential files. Cloud Admin chooses the file, so keep only cloud credentials here."
msgstr "Ụzọ zuru oke gaa na ndekọ faịlụ nke nwere faịlụ nzere. Akaụntụ nwere ike ịgụ nzere ya site na faịlụ naanị n'ime ya, ọ bụghị faịlụ igodo ebe nchekwa nzuzo ma ọlị. Nke tọgbọrọ chakoo, nke bụ ntọala mbụ, na-ajụ faịlụ nzere. Onye Nchịkwa Cloud na-ahọrọ faịlụ ahụ, yabụ debe naanị nzere cloud ebe a."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Collector"
msgstr "Onye Nchịkọta"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Collector Time Budget"
msgstr "Oke Oge Onye Nchịkọta"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds one collector run may spend before it stops starting new work. Keep it below the poller interval; unfinished accounts resume on the next run."
msgstr "Sekọnd nke otu ọrụ onye nchịkọta nwere ike iji tupu ọ kwụsị ịmalite ọrụ ọhụrụ. Debe ya n'okpuru oge etiti poller; akaụntụ ndị na-agwụchabeghị ga-amaliteghachi n'ọrụ na-esote."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Uninstall"
msgstr "Wepụ"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Keep Plugin Tables on Uninstall"
msgstr "Debe Tebụl Mgbakwunye Mgbe A Na-ewepụ"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "When checked, uninstalling the plugin keeps its accounts, encrypted credentials, and cache. Clear it to have the uninstall drop them. Cloud resources are never touched either way."
msgstr "Mgbe ahọpụtara ya, iwepụ mgbakwunye ahụ na-edebe akaụntụ ya, nzere ezochiri ezo, na cache. Hichapụ akara ahụ ka iwepụ ahụ wepụ ha. A naghị emetụ akụrụngwa Cloud aka n'ụzọ ọ bụla."

#: lib/VerifyStatus.php
msgid "Not verified yet."
msgstr "Enyochabeghị ya."

#: lib/VerifyStatus.php
msgid "The credential works and has the permissions this account needs."
msgstr "Nzere ahụ na-arụ ọrụ ma nwee ikike ndị akaụntụ a chọrọ."

#: lib/VerifyStatus.php
msgid "The provider rejected the credential. It may be wrong, expired, or revoked."
msgstr "Onye na-enye ọrụ jụrụ nzere ahụ. O nwere ike ịbụ nke ezighị ezi, nke kubiri, ma ọ bụ nke kagburu."

#: lib/VerifyStatus.php
msgid "The credential works but lacks a permission this account needs."
msgstr "Nzere ahụ na-arụ ọrụ mana o nweghị otu ikike akaụntụ a chọrọ."

#: lib/VerifyStatus.php
msgid "The provider could not be reached. Check the network path and outbound policy from the poller."
msgstr "Enweghị ike iru onye na-enye ọrụ. Lelee ụzọ netwọk na iwu mpụga site na poller."

#: lib/VerifyStatus.php
msgid "The provider is throttling requests. Try again later."
msgstr "Onye na-enye ọrụ na-ebelata arịrịọ. Nwaa ọzọ ma emechaa."

#: lib/VerifyStatus.php
msgid "The provider sent a response the plugin could not read."
msgstr "Onye na-enye ọrụ zitere nzaghachi nke mgbakwunye ahụ enweghị ike ịgụ."

#: lib/VerifyStatus.php
msgid "The account or its credential is not configured correctly."
msgstr "Ahazighị akaụntụ ahụ ma ọ bụ nzere ya nke ọma."

